  {
    "id": "2e8078ee-7054-5cd0-b1a7-b89cfa36fadc",
    "pack": "bestiary-1",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:lich-soul-cage",
    "name": "Lich Soul Cage",
    "level": 12,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["arcane", "void"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "bestiary-1"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This item is crafted by a spellcaster who wishes to become a lich. When a lich is destroyed, its soul flees to the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soul cage",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The phylactery then rebuilds the lich's undead body over the course of 1d10 days. Afterward, the lich manifests next to the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soul cage",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", fully healed and in a new body (therefore, it lacks any equipment it had on its old body). A lich's "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soul cage",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " must be destroyed to prevent a lich from returning."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The standard "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soul cage",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is a sealed metal box containing strips of parchment inscribed with magical phrases. This box has Hardness 9 and 36 HP, but some liches devise more durable or difficult-to-obtain "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soul cages",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". A "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soul cage",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " might also come in the form of a ring, an amulet, or a similar item; the specifics are up to the creator."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
